- `apps/web` auth — email-code sign-in + JWT sessions per BP §9: 15-min HS256 access cookie + rotating single-use refresh token (hashed in Redis), `iss`/`aud` pinned, `timingSafeEqual` verify, 3 codes/email/hour, no existence leak. **Dev login** (`POST /api/auth/dev-login`, button on `/login`) works only when `DEV_LOGIN_ENABLED=true` AND the runtime isn't production — the gate is server-resolved (BP §24). Emails via Resend + React Email templates in `emails/` (BP §8). A refresh 401 means the session is dead (sign out once); a network/5xx failure is transient — never collapse the two (BP §9.7).
